// Windows exe icon. The shell shows the lowest-numbered ICON resource in the
// taskbar, alt-tab and Explorer, so this one is 1 and the only one.
//
// A running window sets its own icon from the svg embedded in the binary
// (Engine::OnInitialize), which is the path that works on Linux too. This is
// what the file shows before anyone launches it.
1 ICON "../assets/branding/recreation.ico"
